ent-WFMobGlowSlug = glowing slug
    .desc = A fat green slug that gives off its own light. It wants nothing to do with you.

ent-WFMobGravityCrab = gravity crab
    .desc = An ore crab grown dense and slow under Aerumna's weight. Each claw hits like a falling boulder.

ent-WFAerumnaGlowcap = glowcap
    .desc = A pale cap that glows a soft green. Carry it as a light, or cook two in a bowl for soup.

ent-WFAerumnaSapPod = sap pod
    .desc = A pod of glowing blue sap. It gives off light, and the sap inside is sweet and harmless.

ent-WFAerumnaMindFogCap = mind-fog cap
    .desc = A purple cap that smells faintly of rain. Eating it clouds the mind and makes things swim.

ent-WFAerumnaGlowshroom = glowshrooms
    .desc = A patch of glowing mushrooms. The caps can be picked and carried as lights, and they grow back.

ent-WFAerumnaSapPlant = sap plant
    .desc = A thin stalk hung with pods of glowing blue sap. They can be picked, and they grow back.

ent-WFAerumnaSporePod = spore pod
    .desc = A taut white bulb. It looks ready to burst into blinding spores if anything gets close, then needs time to fill again.

ent-WFAerumnaLuceVine = luce-vine
    .desc = A tangle of blue vine that tends the xenonids nesting nearby and lashes anything else that comes close.

ent-WFAerumnaMindFogMushroom = mind-fog mushroom
    .desc = A purple mushroom that grows only in the deepest forest. The cap can be picked, but eating it clouds the mind.

reagent-name-wf-glow-sap = glow sap
reagent-desc-wf-glow-sap = A sweet, glowing sap from Aerumna's sap pods. Harmless.

wf-flora-sporepod-burst = The spore pod bursts in your face!
wf-flora-lucevine-lash = {CAPITALIZE(THE($plant))} lashes out at you!
